---
/** Opening paragraph, larger than the body text: <Lead>…</Lead> */
---

<div class="lead"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.125em;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .lead :global(p) {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .lead :global(p + p) {
    margin-top: 1em;
  }
</style>
